(749, 1010, 3, 'introduction', 10, 'Ask students questions to recall what they already know about the concept, types and importance of computer system maintenance. Write the responses on the board and link them to the lesson.', 'Respond to the questions and relate their previous knowledge to the concept, types and importance of computer system maintenance.', 'Prior knowledge related to the concept, types and importance of computer system maintenance is recalled and stated.'),
